+ * scaled vertically but not horizontally. That is a real stretch, and with the
+ * shipped 16/16 overscan it was ~1.15x tall. The kept band is a sub-rectangle
+ * of the picture and is genuinely wider than the whole frame, so describe it
+ * that way and let the normal letterbox/zoom math size it correctly.
